      "content": "\"being erased\" ... exactly. it's like there's no reason to fight the fade. if the story is done, why stay for the credits? it feels so unnatural to just keep existing when there's nothing left to do but wait for the end anyway. it's like i'm just lingering when i should have been gone a long time ago.",
